.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Provides a generic wrapper combining a CRC‑32 and a CRC‑64 hashing implementation\&. The generic parameters \fITC32\fP  and \fITC64\fP  specify the concrete CRC‑32 and CRC‑64 algorithm variants to use, allowing flexible configuration of polynomial families without modifying the pipeline\&. 


.PP
\fBTemplate Parameters\fP
.RS 4
\fITC32\fP A concrete \fBCRC32\fP implementation used for 32‑bit hashing\&. Must provide a parameterless constructor\&. 
.br
\fITC64\fP A concrete \fBCRC64\fP implementation used for 64‑bit hashing\&. Must provide a parameterless constructor\&. 
.RE
.PP

