.SH "Property Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "Pair<Optional<uint>, Optional<ulong> > SystemEx\&.Hash\&.CrC< TC32, TC64 >\&.Polynomial\fR [get]\fP, \fR [set]\fP"

.PP
Gets or sets the CRC‑32 and CRC‑64 polynomials simultaneously\&. The first element of the pair corresponds to the CRC‑32 polynomial, and the second element corresponds to the CRC‑64 polynomial\&. If an element is \fBOptional<T>\&.HasValue\fP = \fRfalse\fP, the corresponding polynomial remains unchanged\&. 

.PP
Setting either polynomial regenerates the lookup table of the underlying CRC implementation and resets its rolling state\&. 
